OL,3,GNEWSAMetro ticket evaders now face #100
OL,4,Afines
OL,5,
OL,6,FTicket evaders on the West Midlands
OL,7,FMetro will face a #100 penalty as a new
OL,8,Finspection scheme comes into force.
OL,10,FRevenue officers are set to carry out
OL,11,Fregular inspections under the Buy
OL,12,FBefore You Board (BBYB) scheme, which
OL,13,Fhas been fully introduced.
OL,15,FThe changes mean passengers can no
OL,16,Flonger purchase a ticket from
OL,17,Fconductors while on board the tram and
OL,18,Fmust buy a valid ticket or pass before
OL,19,Fclimbing aboard.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
