OL,3,GNEWSAMetro ticket evaders now face #100
OL,4,Afines
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the new rules, anyone who is
OL,7,Fcaught travelling on a tram, or on the
OL,8,Fplatform having just got off one
OL,9,Fwithout a valid ticket or pass, may be
OL,10,Fliable to pay the #100 penalty fare.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
